menu "E-TUBE tap"

    config TAP_SELFTEST
        bool "Output a 1 MHz self-test signal on GPIO2 (XIAO D1)"
        default n
        help
            Phase 4 bench test: feed GPIO2 through a 10k/1k divider into C1
            and tune RV1 until GPIO4 shows a clean 500 ns / 500 ns square wave.
            Turn this off before connecting to the bike.

endmenu
